    "sentence_translations": [
      "I Don’t Want Any Red Envelopes",
      "",
      "Every Spring Festival, Little Ming receives many red envelopes.",
      "This year's Spring Festival when his parents gave him a red envelope, Little Ming said:",
      "“I don’t want a red envelope this year. Just buy me a present!”",
      "His mom asked him why, and he said:",
      "“Every year you give me a red envelope, and each time you take it back the next day, saying you will help me save it.”",
      "“I can't use the money, so just give me a present or something else that I can at least use...”"
    ]
